<text id="02-output-contract" title="C# Background Services Output Contract" version="1.2.0" est_tokens="900" depth="essential">
  <summary>JSON Schema (draft-07) for the worker-spec artefact this methodology produces. The validator script enforces required fields, per-field constraints and forbidden combinations. Output that fails the schema is rejected.</summary>

  <section title="Schema">
    <code lang="json"><![CDATA[
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://faion.net/schemas/csharp-background-services.json",
  "title": "C# Background Services worker spec",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "worker_class",
    "channel",
    "scope_strategy",
    "stopping_token_propagated",
    "exception_handling",
    "health_check",
    "owner",
    "version",
    "last_reviewed"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "worker_class": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9]+Service$"},
    "base_class": {"type": "string", "const": "BackgroundService"},
    "channel": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["mode", "capacity", "full_mode"],
      "properties": {
        "mode": {"enum": ["bounded", "none"]},
        "capacity": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
        "full_mode": {"enum": ["Wait", "DropOldest", "DropNewest"]}
      }
    },
    "schedule": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {"enum": ["periodic-timer", "queue-driven", "poll-loop"]},
        "period_seconds": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}
      }
    },
    "scope_strategy": {"enum": ["create-scope-per-item", "no-scoped-deps"]},
    "stopping_token_propagated": {"type": "boolean", "const": true},
    "exception_handling": {"enum": ["try-catch-per-item"]},
    "log_scope_per_item": {"type": "boolean"},
    "health_check": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["registered"],
      "properties": {
        "registered": {"type": "boolean"},
        "stale_after_seconds": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}
      }
    },
    "rules_checked": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {"type": "string"}
    },
    "owner": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2},
    "version": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+$"},
    "last_reviewed": {"type": "string", "format": "date"}
  }
}
]]></code>
  </section>

  <example valid="true">
    <code lang="json"><![CDATA[
{
  "worker_class": "OrderProcessorService",
  "base_class": "BackgroundService",
  "channel": {"mode": "bounded", "capacity": 1000, "full_mode": "Wait"},
  "schedule": {"kind": "queue-driven"},
  "scope_strategy": "create-scope-per-item",
  "stopping_token_propagated": true,
  "exception_handling": "try-catch-per-item",
  "log_scope_per_item": true,
  "health_check": {"registered": true, "stale_after_seconds": 300},
  "rules_checked": ["extend-backgroundservice", "bounded-channel", "scope-per-item"],
  "owner": "ruslan@faion.net",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "last_reviewed": "2026-05-23"
}
]]></code>
  </example>

  <example valid="false">
    <code lang="json"><![CDATA[
{
  "worker_class": "orderWorker",
  "base_class": "IHostedService",
  "channel": {"mode": "none", "capacity": 0, "full_mode": "Wait"},
  "scope_strategy": "no-scoped-deps",
  "stopping_token_propagated": false,
  "exception_handling": "try-catch-per-item",
  "health_check": {"registered": false},
  "owner": "team",
  "version": "draft"
}
]]></code>
    <note>worker_class violates PascalCase + Service suffix; base_class is the raw interface; stopping_token_propagated=false; owner is a collective noun; version is not semver.</note>
  </example>

  <section title="Forbidden patterns">
    <antipattern>
      <description>`channel.mode == "none"` AND `scope_strategy == "no-scoped-deps"` AND the worker uses a `Task.Run` loop.</description>
      <reason>Bypasses BackgroundService entirely. Reject — violates `extend-backgroundservice`.</reason>
    </antipattern>
    <antipattern>
      <description>`channel.mode == "bounded"` AND `channel.full_mode` absent.</description>
      <reason>A bounded channel without a back-pressure mode is meaningless. Violates `bounded-channel`.</reason>
    </antipattern>
    <antipattern>
      <description>`scope_strategy == "no-scoped-deps"` while the constructor lists `DbContext` or other scoped services.</description>
      <reason>Captive-dependency violation of `scope-per-item`.</reason>
    </antipattern>
    <antipattern>
      <description>`schedule.kind == "periodic-timer"` with no `period_seconds`, or a `poll-loop` implemented with `Task.Delay` and no token.</description>
      <reason>Violates `periodic-timer-not-delay-loop` and `pass-stoppingtoken`.</reason>
    </antipattern>
    <antipattern>
      <description>`owner` equals "team" / "we" / "us" / empty string, or `version` frozen while the spec content changed.</description>
      <reason>An unowned or unversioned artefact cannot be reviewed or superseded.</reason>
    </antipattern>
  </section>

  <reference path="scripts/validate-csharp-background-services.py">Validator script (stdlib-only; --help + --self-test)</reference>
</text>
